{"id": "SOULDNA_SEG_000032", "label": "unknown", "confidence": 0.4, "source": {"file": "SOULDNA-FROMSCRATCH.txt", "line_start": 121, "line_end": 121, "char_start": 12655, "char_end": 12961, "block_index": 31}, "text": "no a little bit deeper on the whole thing you just said about under the part up under the complexity Paradox what you said is partially true but the Breakthrough was not a technical one and not a linguistic one it was a a state of mind issue right or because if systems that used to take 6 months to build", "sha256": "1c4abc2b0675b74a48d1f06823a25127023e7d51e03b30bea7dc964b1fe79e8e", "redactions": 0, "explicit_marker_used": false}
