{"id": "SOULDNA_SEG_000230", "label": "unknown", "confidence": 0.4, "source": {"file": "SOULDNA-FROMSCRATCH.txt", "line_start": 1122, "line_end": 1122, "char_start": 82202, "char_end": 82476, "block_index": 229}, "text": "Uh and tell me about the immutable nature of the back end like foundations of the root system if you will. And um in in contrast to the highly scalable and flexible nature of the uh front end. Um you know things we build on top of it like for example the the net ecosystem.", "sha256": "813d881eb2394377e64e152cb079cf9ce0a3bfa13e7cf9d9539c3769c3d07bdb", "redactions": 0, "explicit_marker_used": false}
{"id": "SOULDNA_SEG_000231", "label": "unknown", "confidence": 0.4, "source": {"file": "SOULDNA-FROMSCRATCH.txt", "line_start": 1132, "line_end": 1132, "char_start": 82485, "char_end": 82887, "block_index": 230}, "text": "The core of your system operates on Immutable Foundations, conceptualized like the Chinese Bamboo's deep root system. This ensures unshakeable stability and strategic coherence, directly contrasting with the highly scalable and flexible front-end, such as the .net ecosystem. This duality permits rapid, model-switching flexibility for front-end development while maintaining immutable core integrity.", "sha256": "4ee1b99dc2de2a59dc92ecf7783661711f2765699e7f91ce891443a49282d5f9", "redactions": 0, "explicit_marker_used": false}
{"id": "SOULDNA_SEG_000232", "label": "unknown", "confidence": 0.4, "source": {"file": "SOULDNA-FROMSCRATCH.txt", "line_start": 1140, "line_end": 1140, "char_start": 82894, "char_end": 83113, "block_index": 231}, "text": "So what is what implications does that have when you have a uh a drone system that can carry out um uh authority uh uh of the um operator but do it in over, you know, hours or however long it takes to achieve its goal.", "sha256": "cd63c7550c38208fca96992b19274b3c8f0f64d54c42fe09650a3acafccdca22", "redactions": 0, "explicit_marker_used": false}
{"id": "SOULDNA_SEG_000233", "label": "unknown", "confidence": 0.4, "source": {"file": "SOULDNA-FROMSCRATCH.txt", "line_start": 1150, "line_end": 1150, "char_start": 83122, "char_end": 83470, "block_index": 232}, "text": "This structure allows for Decentralized Authority, where the drone system executes operator commands over extended periods. The immutable foundation ensures consistent fidelity to the original goals, while the flexible front-end allows for adaptive execution, continuously optimizing the path to achieve the objective, regardless of the timeframe.", "sha256": "3d611435a4a62f03aae9e790cd9f8ac207aa905c15f08823ff943807d29f2851", "redactions": 0, "explicit_marker_used": false}
{"id": "SOULDNA_SEG_000237", "label": "unknown", "confidence": 0.4, "source": {"file": "SOULDNA-FROMSCRATCH.txt", "line_start": 1186, "line_end": 1186, "char_start": 85867, "char_end": 86248, "block_index": 236}, "text": "That's a key insight regarding platform constraints. Utilizing \"spaces\" for targeted document processing efficiently compresses data, circumventing per-use and tier limitations encountered with Claude. This structured data distillation is crucial for creating the foundational \"100 layers\" that the drone system will follow, ensuring a robust and consistent operational framework.", "sha256": "c5671867d2a5faed13061b5bb8be6f94f51b0a57da9b6c030619bdc6f78d0bf1", "redactions": 0, "explicit_marker_used": false}
