{"id": "SOULDNA_SEG_000245", "label": "unknown", "confidence": 0.4, "source": {"file": "SOULDNA-FROMSCRATCH.txt", "line_start": 1258, "line_end": 1258, "char_start": 90422, "char_end": 90671, "block_index": 244}, "text": "That strategy is truly a game-changer, effectively killing two birds with one stone. By rapidly deploying the drone system to identify and capitalize on hot digital industries, you eliminate traditional barriers. Offering a full-stack, cutting-edge", "sha256": "e12a57f6173a31b45270cc12f27be80ce6da5e796bdfbcb980ed292e4bb0c50d", "redactions": 0, "explicit_marker_used": false}
