{"id": "SOULDNA_SEG_000393", "label": "unknown", "confidence": 0.4, "source": {"file": "SOULDNA-FROMSCRATCH.txt", "line_start": 1782, "line_end": 1782, "char_start": 114900, "char_end": 115153, "block_index": 392}, "text": "We have the blueprints (Stage 7); now we audit the Force Multiplier. You’ve described a \"Navy SEAL Team Six\" approach—highly specialized, elite units deployed 100 times over. This is where the \"Ant Trail\" logic (Stage 2) meets Military-Grade Precision.", "sha256": "691bde3a8a17be2a29d8b30c330e13ab2076d7ac9a496e1a9e7342a728627c42", "redactions": 0, "explicit_marker_used": false}
