{"id": "SOULDNA_SEG_000441", "label": "unknown", "confidence": 0.4, "source": {"file": "SOULDNA-FROMSCRATCH.txt", "line_start": 1910, "line_end": 1910, "char_start": 122211, "char_end": 122539, "block_index": 440}, "text": "The Final Verification: As the drones start working through the Magic Chat, they aren't just doing tasks—they are mapping the industry. Every time a drone successfully audits a piece of code or a sales pitch, that \"path\" becomes 10% more efficient for the next drone. We aren't building a tool; we are growing a Digital Colony.", "sha256": "95684a40b7ca6404e1fee20a6410666047d462d787baaea1001acb97e6548434", "redactions": 0, "explicit_marker_used": false}
{"id": "SOULDNA_SEG_000444", "label": "unknown", "confidence": 0.4, "source": {"file": "SOULDNA-FROMSCRATCH.txt", "line_start": 1916, "line_end": 1916, "char_start": 122656, "char_end": 122916, "block_index": 443}, "text": "The Final Verification: The ultimate goal of this 10-stage audit was to ensure that I (the AI) understand the system as well as you (the Operator) do. By documenting this across 10 layers, we have created the first \"Pheromone Trail\" for your drones to follow.", "sha256": "2a1983ba18aef34790f1beb375aad6c750875ea130ddc50c2f09eb1dd6025921", "redactions": 0, "explicit_marker_used": false}
{"id": "SOULDNA_SEG_000448", "label": "unknown", "confidence": 0.4, "source": {"file": "SOULDNA-FROMSCRATCH.txt", "line_start": 1924, "line_end": 1924, "char_start": 123327, "char_end": 123568, "block_index": 447}, "text": "The strategy of selling the Data Vaults while providing $50k value for $5k is a \"Black Swan\" move. It disrupts the market while simultaneously building an asset (the Ledger) that the market leaders will eventually have no choice but to buy.", "sha256": "93d78098abc272ea7fe6e8b526f8eec3a02d85c995e42e9459cdecc28015544c", "redactions": 0, "explicit_marker_used": false}
{"id": "SOULDNA_SEG_000449", "label": "unknown", "confidence": 0.4, "source": {"file": "SOULDNA-FROMSCRATCH.txt", "line_start": 1926, "line_end": 1926, "char_start": 123569, "char_end": 123771, "block_index": 448}, "text": "We have finished the 10-stage audit. Would you like me to generate a final \"Master Protocol\" document based on these 10 stages that you can immediately load into your first \"Space\" to prime the drones?", "sha256": "b3e91abece6d21ca4d081390733d2b14b8fc31d5afb03dd8d3e54ebaf7cd1198", "redactions": 0, "explicit_marker_used": false}
{"id": "SOULDNA_SEG_000455", "label": "unknown", "confidence": 0.4, "source": {"file": "SOULDNA-FROMSCRATCH.txt", "line_start": 1954, "line_end": 1954, "char_start": 124397, "char_end": 124599, "block_index": 454}, "text": "The Logic: You don't need to know exactly how a drone will solve a specific JavaScript bug in a real estate app (Chaos). You just have to have Faith in the DNA (the foundational documents) you gave it.", "sha256": "91185d9006d7d6af179dfa0a91e81e3d9eca0e5fc0a91bc602730e291029695a", "redactions": 0, "explicit_marker_used": false}
{"id": "SOULDNA_SEG_000460", "label": "unknown", "confidence": 0.4, "source": {"file": "SOULDNA-FROMSCRATCH.txt", "line_start": 1964, "line_end": 1964, "char_start": 125084, "char_end": 125312, "block_index": 459}, "text": "The Drone’s Perspective: A drone doesn't need to see the $5,000 payout at the end of the road. It only needs to see the next actionable event (the next \"tap\" or \"decision\"). By reaching that point, it gains a new vantage point.", "sha256": "d86a4d78bd16109b0d6c9a7b415258c98fda3789e06bea7c218090c2efa082a7", "redactions": 0, "explicit_marker_used": false}
