{"id": "SOULDNA_SEG_000467", "label": "unknown", "confidence": 0.4, "source": {"file": "SOULDNA-FROMSCRATCH.txt", "line_start": 1978, "line_end": 1978, "char_start": 126078, "char_end": 126402, "block_index": 466}, "text": "PhaseActionOutcomeChaosEntering the unknown digital market.Noise and uncertainty.FaithDeploying drones based on the Immutable DNA.Movement despite the noise.VisibilityReaching the \"edge\" of the current plan.An Actionable Event is triggered.FurtherThe Ledger records the success/failure.The Map expands, and the Vault grows.", "sha256": "e52694ea95a3a84568f62f587df1fae0cc1fe9bd3c1a0ce2c1a9dce002e8984e", "redactions": 0, "explicit_marker_used": false}
