{"id": "SOULDNA_SEG_000544", "label": "unknown", "confidence": 0.4, "source": {"file": "SOULDNA-FROMSCRATCH.txt", "line_start": 2288, "line_end": 2288, "char_start": 144592, "char_end": 144982, "block_index": 543}, "text": "Step 3: Phased Layer Generation and Balance The consolidation in Perplexity will then generate the first 100 layers incrementally, ensuring that each phase of the Immutable DNA respects the balance between exploring Chaos and maintaining strategic stability. This deliberate, step-by-step mapping serves as the necessary example for the drones to follow, guaranteeing long-term resilience.", "sha256": "70237c16ab8611e0242b06287b047876672de958c65f347c33d3040120664d6f", "redactions": 0, "explicit_marker_used": false}
{"id": "SOULDNA_SEG_000546", "label": "unknown", "confidence": 0.4, "source": {"file": "SOULDNA-FROMSCRATCH.txt", "line_start": 2306, "line_end": 2306, "char_start": 145140, "char_end": 145512, "block_index": 545}, "text": "The quantifiable show of success for the first and most important stage is the seamless execution and immediate, tangible results displayed on the Command Station front-end. This is confirmed through the natural, conversational control that initiates the drone operations and deploys the 100 layers, validating the balance of \"Slow to go Fast\" and disciplined deployment.", "sha256": "46a9765b977b0a98e2efd1fb96a16778d175f236abbaca77cfcd81b930ac7489", "redactions": 0, "explicit_marker_used": false}
