{"id": "SOULDNA_SEG_000901", "label": "unknown", "confidence": 0.4, "source": {"file": "SOULDNA-FROMSCRATCH.txt", "line_start": 3866, "line_end": 3866, "char_start": 216185, "char_end": 216411, "block_index": 900}, "text": "Edict II: The Zero-Hallucination Anchor. Every output must match the Merkle Root of the \"Library of 500.\" If a Padawan drone generates data that has no \"DNA match\" in the library, Agent 99 will terminate the thread instantly.", "sha256": "3e02da3cf7b9172c38ab1e816d15daaff23c3a1afe60c348a1687edd4dcc539b", "redactions": 0, "explicit_marker_used": false}
